g xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-smartphone h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"20\" x=\"5\" y=\"2\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M12 18h.01\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-medium\">The 24/7 Intake Desk</h3></div><p class=\"opacity-60 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg\">Let customers reach you or book time even when your shop is closed.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Nonprofit & Community Pages\",\"description\":\"Churches, clubs, and local nonprofits get the same simple, honest approach — built to fit a volunteer budget.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://growlocalcreative.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":[{\"@type\":\"AdministrativeArea\",\"name\":\"El Dorado County, CA\"},{\"@type\":\"AdministrativeArea\",\"name\":\"Placer County, CA\"}]}</script><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground flex items-center justify-center transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-medium\">Nonprofit &amp; Community Pages</h3></div><p class=\"opacity-60 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg\">Churches, clubs, and local nonprofits get the same simple, honest approach — built to fit a volunteer budget.</p></div></div></div><div class=\"group\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"AI-Assisted Builds, Transparently\",\"description\":\"I use AI tools to build faster and keep costs down, and I'm upfront about that. I test everything myself before you ever see it.\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://growlocalcreative.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":[{\"@type\":\"AdministrativeArea\",\"name\":\"El Dorado County, CA\"},{\"@type\":\"AdministrativeArea\",\"name\":\"Placer County, CA\"}]}</script><div class=\"flex items-start gap-4\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-xl bg-secondary text-secondary-foreground flex items-center justify-center transition-transform group-hover:scale-110\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-medium\">AI-Assisted Builds, Transparently</h3></div><p class=\"opacity-60 leading-relaxed text-base md:text-lg\">I use AI tools to build faster and keep costs down, and I&#x27;m upfront about that. I test everything myself before you ever see it.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"upcoming\" class=\"py-24 scroll-mt-20\" style=\"background-color:#F7F4ED;color:#1A1A1A\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium mb-4\">What&#x27;s Coming Next</h2><p class=\"opacity-70 text-lg\">Practical digital tools built one neighbor at a time for real everyday business needs.</p></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><a href=\"mailto:growlocalcreative@gmail.com?subject=Joining%20the%20Beta%20for%20Tools&amp;body=Hi%20Renee%2C%20I&#x27;m%20interested%20in%20using%20some%20simple%20tools%20to%20get%20my%20business%20online%20and%20organized.\" class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 group hover:border-secondary transition-all hover:shadow-md h-full text-stone-900\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-template h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"9\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"7\" x=\"16\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-2 flex-grow\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-medium leading-none\">Interactive Digital Menus &amp; Daily Specials</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5 text-stone-300 shrink-0 group-hover:text-secondary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-stone-500 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base\">Update your daily specials, soup of the day, or sold-out items from your phone in 10 seconds — without touching any code.</p><span class=\"inline-block text-sm font-medium text-secondary pt-2\">Join the Beta →</span></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><a href=\"mailto:growlocalcreative@gmail.com?subject=Joining%20the%20Beta%20for%20Tools&amp;body=Hi%20Renee%2C%20I&#x27;m%20interested%20in%20using%20some%20simple%20tools%20to%20get%20my%20business%20online%20and%20organized.\" class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 group hover:border-secondary transition-all hover:shadow-md h-full text-stone-900\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-template h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"9\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"7\" x=\"16\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-2 flex-grow\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-medium leading-none\">Instant QR &amp; Link-in-Bio Card</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5 text-stone-300 shrink-0 group-hover:text-secondary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-stone-500 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base\">One clean link you can put on table tents, takeout boxes, or flyers pointing people to your menu, Instagram, and Google review link.</p><span class=\"inline-block text-sm font-medium text-secondary pt-2\">Join the Beta →</span></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><a href=\"mailto:growlocalcreative@gmail.com?subject=Joining%20the%20Beta%20for%20Tools&amp;body=Hi%20Renee%2C%20I&#x27;m%20interested%20in%20using%20some%20simple%20tools%20to%20get%20my%20business%20online%20and%20organized.\" class=\"bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-stone-100 flex flex-col items-start gap-4 group hover:border-secondary transition-all hover:shadow-md h-full text-stone-900\"><div class=\"h-12 w-12 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 text-primary flex items-center justify-center group-hover:bg-primary group-hover:text-primary-foreground transition-all\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layout-template h-6 w-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"3\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"9\" height=\"7\" x=\"3\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect><rect width=\"5\" height=\"7\" x=\"16\" y=\"14\" rx=\"1\"></rect></svg></div><div class=\"space-y-2 flex-grow\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-medium leading-none\">Simple Customer &amp; Estimate Tracker</h3><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-5 w-5 text-stone-300 shrink-0 group-hover:text-secondary group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"text-stone-500 leading-relaxed text-sm md:text-base\">A lightweight way to track catering inquiries, estimates, or loyal customers without getting bogged down in complicated spreadsheets.</p><span class=\"inline-block text-sm font-medium text-secondary pt-2\">Join the Beta →</span></div></a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"py-24 scroll-mt-20\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#1A1A1A\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:scale(0.95)\"><div class=\"aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] shadow-2xl\"><img src=\"/spruce-leaves.jpg\" alt=\"Spruce leaves in the Foothills\" class=\"h-full w-full object-cover\" referrerPolicy=\"no-referrer\"/></div><div class=\"absolute -bottom-6 -right-6 h-32 w-32 rounded-full bg-secondary flex items-center justify-center text-center p-4 shadow-xl rotate-12\"><span class=\"font-heading text-sm font-bold text-secondary-foreground leading-tight\">Local Partner · Foothills Proud</span></div></div><div class=\"space-y-8\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateX(30px)\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium text-foreground\">&quot;Hi, I&#x27;m your local digital growth partner.&quot;</h2><div class=\"h-1 w-20 bg-primary rounded-full\"></div></div><div class=\"space-y-6 text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\"><p>I live right here in Cool, CA, working with hard-working small business owners across the Georgetown Divide, Auburn, Placerville, and the Foothills. Whether you&#x27;re running a trade crew, serving up comfort food at a local eatery or food truck, or crafting specialty goods, your business deserves a digital presence that actually drives revenue.</p><p>Most agencies charge big-city prices and speak in confusing tech jargon. I don&#x27;t. I take a practical, builder&#x27;s approach: websites that load in a flash on spotty foothill cell connections, clear Google presence, and frictionless forms that send customer inquiries straight to your phone.</p><p class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">I build custom, modern systems tailored to how rural and foothill businesses actually operate, whether that&#x27;s an online menu for hungry weekenders, an instant quote form for home services, or getting your Google listing to reflect your real hours and location.</p><p>Whether your current site is slow and outdated, or you&#x27;re starting fresh, I&#x27;m right down the road to help you look great, build trust, and win more local business.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"faq\" class=\"py-24 scroll-mt-20\" style=\"background-color:#3D4337;color:#F7F4ED\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to already have a domain or hosting?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Nope. If you don't have a domain yet, I'll walk you through getting one and getting it connected. If you already have a site somewhere, I can work with what's there.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do you work with nonprofits and churches, not just businesses?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. I work with small businesses, nonprofits, churches, and local makers across the Georgetown Divide and El Dorado & Placer Counties.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does the free website audit actually include?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"I'll look over your current site and send you a short video walking through 3 simple fixes that could help you get more calls or messages from it - no obligation.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"You mentioned using AI tools. What does that mean for my site?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"I use AI-assisted tools to build faster and keep costs down. I test every site myself before it goes live.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Do I need to sign a long contract?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No long contracts. We talk about what you need, I give you a straightforward price, and we go from there - neighbor to neighbor.\"}}]}</script><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-3xl\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12 space-y-3\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium\">Common Questions</h2><p class=\"opacity-70 text-lg\">The stuff folks usually ask before reaching out.</p></div><div class=\"w-full\" data-orientation=\"vertical\"><div data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" class=\"border-b\"><h3 data-orientation=\"vertical\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"flex\"><button type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" data-state=\"closed\" data-orientation=\"vertical\" id=\"radix-_R_3b5fb5b_\" class=\"flex flex-1 items-center justify-between py-4 font-medium transition-all hover:underline [&amp;[data-state=open]&gt;svg]:rotate-180 text-left font-heading text-lg\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Do I need to already have a domain or hosting?<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></h3><div data-state=\"closed\" id=\"radix-_R_jb5fb5b_\" hidden=\"\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_3b5fb5b_\" data