d you when they search. I'll get your Google listing dialed in so you show up.\"},\"position\":3},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"The 24/7 Intake Desk\",\"description\":\"Let customers reach you or book time even when your shop is closed.\"},\"position\":4},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"Nonprofit & Community Pages\",\"description\":\"Churches, clubs, and local nonprofits get the same simple, honest approach — built to fit a volunteer budget.\"},\"position\":5},{\"@type\":\"Offer\",\"itemOffered\":{\"@type\":\"Service\",\"name\":\"AI-Assisted Builds, Transparently\",\"description\":\"I use AI tools to build faster and keep costs down, and I'm upfront about that. I test everything myself before you ever see it.\"},\"position\":6}]}}10:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"id\":\"services-schema\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$18\"}}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"id\":\"navigation-schema\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ItemList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"SiteNavigationElement\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"About\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growlocalcreative.com/#about\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"SiteNavigationElement\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Services\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growlocalcreative.com/#services\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"SiteNavigationElement\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Free Tools\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growlocalcreative.com/#freebies\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"SiteNavigationElement\\\",\\\"position\\\":4,\\\"name\\\":\\\"FAQ\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://growlocalcreative.com/#faq\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"id\":\"breadcrumb-schema\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"B